g/98px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E7%81%AB%E5%8A%9B%E6%89%93%E5%87%BB%E4%B9%8B%E9%81%93.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/05/356f2550assg8k0mh7wwi2fewaif0lw.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n    <div class=\"gx_name\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E7%81%AB%E5%8A%9B%E6%89%93%E5%87%BB%E4%B9%8B%E9%81%93\" title=\"极限解放/火力打击之道\"><font color=\"#FFF\">火力打击之道</font></a></div>\n    </div>&#160;<div class=\"gx_box\">\n    <div data-type=\"@悬浮框/极限解放\" data-name=\"魔法才女\" class=\"bili-tt gx_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E6%89%8D%E5%A5%B3\" title=\"极限解放/魔法才女\"><img alt=\"技能背景 史诗.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7b/bdxsswq2neqstneo43aobr0kisd0zoh.png/65px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E5%8F%B2%E8%AF%97.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7b/bdxsswq2neqstneo43aobr0kisd0zoh.png/98px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E5%8F%B2%E8%AF%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7b/bdxsswq2neqstneo43aobr0kisd0zoh.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n    <div data-type=\"@悬浮框/极限解放\" data-name=\"魔法才女\" class=\"bili-tt gx_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E6%89%8D%E5%A5%B3\" title=\"极限解放/魔法才女\"><img alt=\"极限解放 魔法才女.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f7/nryl1xpk9fdqyu41fkkeee3bfs6p90v.png/65px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E6%89%8D%E5%A5%B3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f7/nryl1xpk9fdqyu41fkkeee3bfs6p90v.png/98px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E6%89%8D%E5%A5%B3.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f7/nryl1xpk9fdqyu41fkkeee3bfs6p90v.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n    <div class=\"gx_name\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E6%89%8D%E5%A5%B3\" title=\"极限解放/魔法才女\"><font color=\"#FFF\">魔法才女</font></a></div>\n    </div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:15%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色绰号\n</th>\n<td>马鹿、马路\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配置推荐\n</th>\n<td>武器：扩散棱镜、魔力长柄勺、破净万恶之光等<br />装具：血晶石护身符、鸣心辉晶(再移动)、守护正义之盾/原时沙漏等<br />塔罗：魔术师、正义、恶魔等<br />刻印：宝剑+权杖，宝剑+宝剑\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色攻略\n</th>\n<td>按1阶到11阶顺序：右右左左右右，1、3、7和11阶可考虑领悟之力\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">中文CV\n</th>\n<td>郑好\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">日文CV\n</th>\n<td>千本木彩花\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配音展示\n</th>\n<td>【byThAmeReborn】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LWAZeWEyV\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LWAZeWEyV</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色生平\n</th>\n<td>玛露西尔是一名攻守兼备的出色法师——被誉为“魔法学校创始以来的才女”。她极其认真且性格直率，遇事不决便会查阅随身携带的魔法书，寻找解决办法。因此经常和经验主义的森西发生争论。<br />玛露西尔不喜欢猎奇的食物，对吃魔物更是面露难色。“食物中毒怎么办？”她经常这样反对，但往往还是会被森西烹饪魔物的香味所诱惑，最终吃下料理……即使是在充满危险的迷宫中，只要和玛露希尔一起吃饭，就能稍感安心吧？\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022022919\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.304 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.467 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node coun